0,Crimean Karaites - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crimean_Karaites,"Crimean Karaites or simply Karaites (Crimean Karaim: Кърымкъарайлар, Qrımqaraylar, singular къарай, qaray; Trakai dialect: karajlar, singular karaj; Crimean Tatar: Qaraylar), also known more broadly as Eastern European Karaites, are a traditionally Turkic-speaking Judaic ethnoreligious group [8][9] native to Crimea. [10][11][12] Nowadays, most Karaim in Eastern Europe ...",Karaim,Turkic
1,Karaim language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karaim_language,"The Karaim language (Crimean dialect: къарай тили, qaray tili; Trakai dialect: karaj tili), also known by its Hebrew name Lashon Kedar (Hebrew: לשון קדר, lit. 'language of the nomads'), [5] is a Turkic language belonging to the Kipchak group, with Hebrew influences, similarly to Yiddish or Judaeo-Spanish. [6] It is presently spoken by only a few dozen Crimean Karaites ...",Karaim,Turkic
2,Turkish Instrumental Music | Turkish Art Music | Relaxing & Traditional ...,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9w5O050soYo,"Dive into the rich and enchanting world of Turkish instrumental music. This playlist features traditional and modern Turkish melodies played on iconic instruments like the bağlama, ney, and kanun.",Karaim,Turkic
3,Karolina Cicha & Company with Karaim Music Map @ premiere concert,https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6QAbxf9CprKF9uxltKc0ayHgqcgRUTDm,"Listen to Karolina Cicha & Company with Karaim Music Map @ premiere concert on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.",Karaim,Turkic
4,"""Karaim Music Map"" - Karolina Cicha & Company - WOMEX",https://www.womex.com/virtual/sutari_karolina/karolina_cicha/karaim_music_map,"The Karaim Music Map was first launched in 2020 as a virtual project. A year after the internet release, this CD album was produced by Karolina Cicha & Co., as the world's first CD album dedicated to traditional Karaim music. This release was supplemented by a bonus disc featuring songs performed by members of the Karaim community.",Karaim,Turkic
5,Karolina Cicha - Karaim Music Map - the first full album... - Facebook,https://www.facebook.com/karolinacichamusic/posts/karaim-music-map-the-first-full-album-of-traditional-karaim-music-in-the-world-l/3642188242513388/,"Karaim Music Map is the first full album of traditional Karaim music in the world Listen to the singles ""Troch szaharda"" and ""Soframyzda""! The premiere of Karolina Cicha & Company virtual album on October 26 on my YT and the Karaim online map: mapamuzyczna.karaimi.org",Karaim,Turkic
6,"Amazing Tatar music during the exhibition ""Tatars and ... - Facebook",https://www.facebook.com/ltembassykz/videos/amazing-tatar-music-during-the-exhibition-tatars-and-karaims-of-lithuania-organi/1185763292859815/,"Amazing Tatar music during the exhibition ""Tatars and Karaims of Lithuania"" organized by the embassy and the Turkic academy of Astana. #tatar #karaim...",Karaim,Turkic
7,The Karaim music interactive map. : r/Tiele - Reddit,https://www.reddit.com/r/Tiele/comments/vkks9e/the_karaim_music_interactive_map/,"Everything related to the Turkic Peoples - History, Culture, News, Language, Memes, Mythology, etc. •Post titles must be in English.",Karaim,Turkic
8,Karaim Music Map - Karolina Cicha - Karaimska Mapa Muzyczna / a ...,https://www.rootsworld.com/reviews/cicha-22.shtml,"In Poland now only about two hundred people identify themselves as Karaim. Their language, which is of the Turkic group with Hebrew influences, is spoken by only a few dozen today, mainly in the town of Trakai in Lithuania.",Karaim,Turkic
9,Karaim - 𐰆𐰢𐰖 Umay's Children,https://umayschildren.com/karaim/,"Karaim: A small Turkic-speaking group primarily found in Lithuania, Ukraine, and Poland, the Karay are unique for practicing Karaite Judaism. Their language, Karaim, is a preserved Kipchak dialect, and their culture reflects centuries of life at the crossroads of the Turkic and European worlds.",Karaim,Turkic
